(PROP) |sigma_{j-1}(t)| <= (1-t^{R-j})/(1-t) -- EXACT, on true solution paths
   R= 16: exact max violation ratio along the TRUE path = 1  (satisfies and SATURATES (PROP): True)
   R= 32: exact max violation ratio along the TRUE path = 1  (satisfies and SATURATES (PROP): True)
   R= 64: exact max violation ratio along the TRUE path = 1  (satisfies and SATURATES (PROP): True)

